nt, identical slots and other rooms\n- holds at and just before their expiry minute\n- the `maxHoldMinutes` limit from the environment variable\n- `nowMinute` defaulting to 0\n- every way `confirmHold` can fail","ttft_ms":2085,"type":"result","duration_ms":86326,"uuid":"212e8626-fbeb-41d9-b4bf-c67cdd478729","ttft_stream_ms":901,"time_to_request_ms":221,"first_content_frame_ms":902,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-23T22:59:00.336Z"}

